WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.220
What's up guys!

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.220
We are Pongfinity

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.660
Today we are trying out wheelchair table tennis!

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:21.560
Feels quite good

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.760
It's easy if you play to one spot

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:47.060
I didn't see that coming!

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:21.960
We had a session with our friend Aino Tapola

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.660
Who is one of the world's best wheelchair table tennis players in her class (1)

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:29.300
She showed us some of the main tactics and shots in wheelchair table tennis

00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:30.940
And now we are going to try them out!

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:33.140
In wheelchair table tennis

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.760
The serve isn't allowed to come off the side of the table

00:01:36.040 --> 00:01:37.340
So the best serves are:

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.400
A really short one

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.600
Or a long fast one

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.080
No, you see that's not a very good serve!

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.440
No, it's not so good!

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:47.600
The best shot in wheelchair table tennis

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:50.520
Is a short backspin that returns to your own side

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.860
It's very difficult for the opponent to reach

00:01:58.080 --> 00:01:59.760
Yes, I got it!

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:02.300
Okay let's try playing some points against Aino

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.460
Let's see how it goes!

00:02:09.740 --> 00:02:11.740
I just got the one in the corner

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:21.020
It's so tactically different

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.700
It was easier against you Emil!

00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:30.480
I'm wrong way around now...

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.640
Even in wheelchair table tennis I'm doing a lot of extra movement

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:47.500
Too slow!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:03.380
Impossible

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:04.460
Yeah that was good

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.320
Hope you guys found this video interesting

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.020
And let us know in the comments below

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.480
If you want to see a Pongfinity wheelchair tournament

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:12.820
Until next time!

